<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal future trade resumes after technical halt.</title>
<headline>Portugal future trade resumes after technical halt.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in bond and stock futures renewed on the Oporto Derivatives Exchange after being halted by technical problems, an Exchange spokesman said.  </p>
<p>Trade had been halted for about three hours.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
